{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"09027c4b9b921296","type":"text","text":"On the blood stained snowy battlefield the sun rose again and with it the death of Ceasar Volstar cemented permanently in time. After the battle with Verazanoth you all noticed the entirety of the city's people watching you. They watched Ceasar declare you as those who will become the new sword of Volstar while making this proclamation he imbued the power of his sword Sun Splitter in the Hammer of the All-Father creating a new weapon Solaris Calamity. After this weapon was created Stu opened his eyes and was glowing and crackling with golden radiant electricity now marked by both The Dawn Father and The storm Lord. Achillies then gave a speech telling the cities people that a festival will take place in a few days to celebrate Ceasars life. During that break you all did a series of different things Valrich found out both his mother and Neyis Vice are comatose plagued by an arcane sickness known as Dreamers Eternal Slumber, a sickness caused when a mortal attempts to wield more magic then their body physically allows. Aralia spent time with Azest and Alivia. Cassian asked Achillies questions about both him and Ceasar, requesting to see the artifact that Verazanoth attempted to steal. Achillies denied his request telling him that the artifact would drive him insane and make him kill everything he holds dear. Saggnus walked the city streets in hopes to find more on his ring forged in hellsteel. Timora in an attempt to reach out to her mother was met with an answer to her prayers by The Wild Mother herself Milora who told her that her mother is watching and is very proud of her. But all of you went into the neighbourhood helping the citizens repair their homes and aiding the wounded. Following all of that it was time for Ceasars celebration of life, during which you competed in both a eating and drinking competition, winning in both. Near the end of the festival you Alivia approached you all telling you that it was time to walk into the eyes of the public, three speeches were given 1 by Alivia 1 by Valrich and 1 by Achillies. These speeches rallied the peoples hearts and earned their trust. Following that you had a meeting with the newly formed council of The Volstarian Dynasty. During which you met each member some familiar to you others familiar with you. During which you were told of anceint relics known as Vestiges of Divergence, there are 9 in the world and your party carries 3. These relics are used to destroy the dolls given to you by Verazanoth and are relics of unthinkable power, each relic said to hold the power of 100 men. So we pick up in lights respite all of you deciding to head toward Armount in search of the relic left behind by Avandra The Change Bringer.\n\n---------------------\n\nAlivia will tell them to give her a days notice before they want to leave so she can make preparations \n\n\nThe party will then have the rest of the night to do what they wish Ill kinda improv whatever they wanna do and I guess the next stuff is more open then linear. \n","x":-700,"y":-700,"width":880,"height":780},
		{"id":"7e17cf1ea2593253","type":"text","text":"The Library:\n\nCurrently at the library most tomes from the forbidden section are destroyed with only pieces of some intact.\n\nDC 5 INV\n\nA red book labeled \"The nine Hells\".\n\nDC 10 INV\nA dark green book labeled \"The demise of WildFort\"\n\nDC 25 INV \nA white and gold book labeled \"The history of the Dawn Father\"\n\nDC 20 INV\nA purple book labeled \"A Dreamers Slumber (Theories of Lillete Torvier)\"\n\nDC 25 INV\nA black book labeled \"The fall of Armount\"\n\nRefer to Book-> Volstar Forbidden section session 22\n","x":-680,"y":220,"width":600,"height":500},
		{"id":"00b270618756a8e3","type":"text","text":"Their departure: \n\nWhen the party wishes to depart on their journey they will be wished good look and gazed upon by the people of the city they swore to save and the nation it resides in.\n\n\nFloating in the skies above the city of Volstar from the top of the mountain peak beside the Hellos academy and below the Castle of Volstar, Azest Thyless begins to channel energy in the palms of her hands and you watch a familiar relic appear the Dreamers Heart and with it you watch her open a familiar door which shatters leaving behind a volatile shacking fracture in space the dreamers heart then shoots a beem of purple energy into it and you watch the fracture crack and split the fabric of the universe around you opening into a space that leads into her dimension and approaching is a gigantic ship with three large purple clothed sails, a wooden frame lined in metal and four huge rocks on each corner of the ship glowing a bright blue keeping the ship aloft. Engraved on the side \"Veridian\". Following it a gigantic plat form hundreds of feet tall with multiple ports for a sky ship to dock at attaches to the mountain side she then says \"Approach Solaris journey awaits. That was fucking cringe it sounded better in my head\"\n\nAs you are drifting from the port that rests at the top of the Sky View District into the bright morning sun below you are the people of the city chanting your name Solaris Verdict and the call of their people Ardens Solaris as the sky ship begins to pick up speed you all know that there will forever be a home for you to return to in Volstar.\n\n\n","x":-60,"y":222,"width":791,"height":498},
		{"id":"ee8ea3424bb56efb","type":"text","text":"The Trip in the skies:\n\nSunny weather \n\nBeautiful forest scape\n\nMiloras waters\n\nGiagantic mountain of yormindar\n\nHuge mountain range weeks off in the distance \n\n","x":-680,"y":780,"width":341,"height":347},
		{"id":"84206bddcdfe9728","type":"text","text":" Dis Vlakith:\n\nCurrently within the cell is a torch lit room with the same material walls ceiling and floor and strapped standing to a cross being repeatedly struck with a whip that is spiked like a flail at the end held by Azest Thyless is a creature dark grey skin blind folded and crucified.\n\nThis creature is unmistakably a Devil and a powerful one. 6 inch clawed fingers hooved feet and a tail that is currently pinned down by residuum spikes.\n\nAzest\n\"Why does Asmodeus want Volstars fall AND WHAT DOES HE WANT WITH THE CHILDREN OF LUMIERE, for four days straight I have been merciful only physically torturing you refuse this question again and I will resort to means that I don’t even want to do to a devil Dis Vlakith, answer now or suffer a fate worse then death.\"\n\nDis\n\"Just wait whore I cant wait to break free from here make you into my slave that I can do whatever I want with. Oh don’t worry I'll let you watch as I bring your new girlfriend to the God of Torture and I'll laugh as she suffers for in eternal anguish for his goals.\"\nAzest\n\"Your empty threats to me do nothing to me but put the names of those I care about and not even you God can save you from my wrath.  Dreamer awaken\"\n\nYou watch Azests eyes begin to glow purple and feel reality begin to bend and gravity begins to get heavy enough to the point your all brought to your knees and a familiar artifact apparates in her hands\n\nAzest\n\"Dreamer Open the barrier between space, rip the mind of the devil before me. Put it all on display, show me his truth, show me the city of Dis, show me what they plan for the Lumiere.\"\n\n\nYou watch as a thread strings from the heart to Dis and Azests eyes begin to glow brighter and she begins to bleed from her eyes, ears and nose.\n\nOnce it reach's Dis you can see the image of Asmodeus locking Aralia in a cell in his lair of hell with spikes stabbing into her and her blood dripping into a pool of souls that begin to swell with power and time passes 1000 years Aralia trapped as a facet of blood and once the time passes a rift shatters throw a gate of lightning opening into the material plane.\n\nAzest\n\"Vile disgusting creatures I will never allow you to condemn her to that……….. Good get a laugh in it will be your last. Heart Scatter\"\n\nYou watch as the magic within the dreamers heart grows unstable and Azest begins to cough blood. The thread shatters into millions  more and the light dims.\n\nAzest\n\"He is reduced to a mindless creature *2x Cough* ask him what you wish his mind will only last for 3 questions before he is completely unresponsive now I need some rest\"\n\nAnd she walks to the door way her feet touch the ground and she rests on a chair for a moment still with you but giving you the floor.\n\n\nImma wing it on what info he would have\n\n","x":240,"y":-760,"width":1280,"height":920},
